# Read by Netlify/Cloudflare Pages on static deploy (README §15's zero-cost
# hosting options) — ignored elsewhere, harmless to ship either way.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(self), camera=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https:; img-src 'self' data:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; script-src 'self'
